Revision history for WWW-VastAI

{{$NEXT}}

    - Expand synchronous Vast.ai API coverage:
      - account helpers via API::User for profile updates, subaccounts,
        cloud integrations, IP history, and credit transfer
      - instance helpers via API::Instances for bid updates, deposit lookup,
        prepay, reboot, recycle, and remote command execution
      - per-instance SSH key attach/detach via Instance entity
      - serverless endpoint update and synchronous route requests
    - Align serverless worker/log helper requests with the documented
      run.vast.ai request fields
    - Add mock coverage for the new account, instance, and serverless helpers
    - Improve POD across all modules: document client attributes, add
      SEE ALSO cross-references, document all Instance lifecycle methods
    - Expand README with account management, serverless, and volume examples
    - Load URI::QueryParam in Role::HTTP so requests carrying query
      parameters work on every supported URI version, covered by
      t/query-params.t (GitHub issue 1)

0.001     2026-03-12

    - Initial release
    - Add WWW::VastAI client with a shared HTTP layer and central operation map
    - Cover Vast.ai marketplace offers, instances, templates, volumes,
      SSH keys, API keys, current user, env vars, invoices, endpoints,
      and workergroups
    - Provide entity objects for the main resource types
    - Add mock-driven unit tests for all implemented resource groups
    - Add POD for the entity, transport, and IO helper classes
    - Add direct unit tests for entity accessors and the LWP IO adapter
    - Add opt-in live tests:
      - C<VAST_LIVE_TEST=1> enables read-only API coverage
      - C<VAST_LIVE_ALLOW_COST=1> enables cost-incurring instance and volume
        lifecycle tests
